hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"46","[AI-translation] Alituhadithia Hajjaj bin Minhal, alituhadithia Shu'ba, alisema: Alinijulisha Abu Iyas, alisema: Nimemsikia Abdullah bin Mughaffal akisema: Nilimuona Mtume wa Allah (ﷺ) siku ya ushindi wa Makka, naye akisoma akiwa juu ya kipando chake Sura al-Fath."
"47","[AI-translation] Kutoka kwa Abu Lubaba (Allah amridhie) alisema: A'isha (Allah amridhie) alisema: Nabii (ﷺ) hakulala hadi asome (sura) az-Zumar na Bani Isra'il."
"48","[AI-translation] Kutoka kwa Ubaydullah bin Abdullah: Kwamba Umar bin al-Khattab alimuuliza Abu Waqid al-Laythi ni nini alichokuwa akisoma nacho Mtume wa Allah (ﷺ) katika (sala ya) Adhha na Fitr, akasema: Alikuwa akisoma humo: (Qaf, Naapa kwa Qur'an Tukufu) na (Kimekaribia Saa na mwezi umepasuka)."
